  "question": {
    "text": "The sum <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>15</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to",
